{"id": 424785, "field": "name", "en": "Saber Slash", "hash": "502c2de7d1ebba9d", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70124"}
{"id": 424785, "field": "description", "en": "Viciously slash an enemy for $s2% weapon damage, and cause the target to bleed for ${$AP*$m4/100} damage every $t4 sec for $d, stacking up to $u times. Each stack also increases damage done by your Saber Slash and Sinister Strike by $s5%. Awards $s3 combo $lpoint:points;.\r\n\r\nSaber Slash benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or modify Sinister Strike.", "hash": "72e45558842548d5", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70124"}
