{"id": 424799, "field": "description", "en": "Instantly attack with your off-hand weapon to deal normal off-hand weapon damage with a 100% chance to apply the poison from your off-hand weapon to the target. Slower weapons require more energy. Awards $s2 combo $lpoint:points;.\r\n\r\nShiv benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or modify Sinister Strike.", "hash": "b5aa7d3f22b1d824", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70124"}
