{"id": 424919, "field": "name", "en": "Main Gauche", "hash": "cd3cc36df1314024", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70124"}
{"id": 424919, "field": "description", "en": "Instantly strike with your off-hand weapon for normal off-hand weapon damage and increase your chance to parry by $s2% for $d or until you successfully parry. For $462752d after using Main Gauche, Sinister Strike costs $462752s1 less Energy, deals $462752s2% more threat, grants stacks of Rolling with the Punches, and both Sinister Strike and Eviscerate deal $462752s3% more damage. Awards $s3 combo $lpoint:points;.\r\n\r\nMain Gauche benefits from most talents and effects that trigger from or modify Sinister Strike. Main Gauche's effect will not discount or empower Main Gauche.", "hash": "c4245e6a12245f26", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70124"}
{"id": 424919, "field": "aura", "en": "Parry chance increased by $s2%.", "hash": "ea59a9beb469fd5a", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70124"}
